    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d591">

                <pb facs="0699" n="625" xml:id="pg625"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2410</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kandalaksha</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1918-08-02T02:06:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1918-07-31T00:00:00+04:31"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August
                            2, 1918, 2.06 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Poole<anchor n="1" xml:id="d591-f1"/>
                    reports having advised you departure of Diplomatic Corps from Vologda and causes
                    therefor. …<anchor n="2" xml:id="d591-f2"/> My intention and desire to remain in
                    Russia. [Have not changed?] my judgment as to our having ambassador here. My
                    stay at Kandalaksha and subsequent location will be influenced by developments.
                    Plan to return to Vologda when safe. [Will] advise the Department by cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d591-f1" n="1" xml:id="d591-f1-content">
                <p>
                    DeWitt C. Poole, Consul at Moscow.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d591-f2" n="2" xml:id="d591-f2-content">
                <p>The detailed account of the trip, hopelessly garbled in transmission, is omitted.
                    Another account is given in the Ambassador’s telegram No. 350, Aug. 4, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
